// Ayahs across surahs: %1$@ is the start and %2$@ is the end reference, such as "Al-Baqarah 2:286 – Āli-ʿImrān 3:10". Ayahs in one surah are written "Al-Baqarah 2:1–10" without this format. Translators may reorder the placeholders.
